這份授權只涵蓋本專案的原始碼，不涵蓋以下兩件事：

一、歌曲。
    本專案播放的是 Apple Music 官方的 30 秒試聽，由 Apple 的伺服器直接串流；
    本專案不下載、不轉存、不再散布任何音訊，web/data/bank.js 裡只有歌名、
    演出者與 Apple 的試聽網址。所有歌曲的著作權屬於原權利人。
    本專案與 Apple Inc. 無任何關係，亦未經其背書。

二、玩法的原始構想。
    九選一、每題十二秒、語種逐關解鎖這套玩法，參考自台大流行音樂創作社的
    「金曲猜歌王」https://github.com/ntupm18th/ntupm-songguesser （MIT）。
    本專案為獨立實作，未取用其程式碼、題庫或素材。

This license covers the source code only. It does not cover the songs: audio is
streamed directly from Apple's servers as official Apple Music 30-second
previews; this project never downloads, stores, proxies or redistributes any
audio, and all songs remain the property of their respective rights holders.
This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Apple Inc.

The game design (nine choices, twelve seconds, languages unlocking stage by
stage) is inspired by NTUPM's "ntupm-songguesser" (MIT). This is an independent
implementation; no code, song bank or assets were taken from it.
